{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Denied</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game set inside a decaying mental asylum where something unnatural stalks the halls. You're trapped, weaponless, and constantly hunted by the\u00a0<strong>Morph</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you\u2019ll need to <strong>search the facility</strong>, gather hidden components, and <strong>build a weapon from scratch</strong>. But the Morph won't wait. It adapts. It listens. It <strong>knows</strong> you're trying to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the weapon is ready, <strong>the final confrontation begins</strong>. You\u2019ll have only one chance. And one shot.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878370?t=1757615131","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878370?t=1757615131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878370/ad9add1c6ec2b4ca2b7f349fa1b1ca7ffbdfee4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757615131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878370/ad9add1c6ec2b4ca2b7f349fa1b1ca7ffbdfee4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757615131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Denied</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game set inside a decaying mental asylum where something unnatural stalks the halls. You're trapped, weaponless, and constantly hunted by the\u00a0<strong>Morph</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you\u2019ll need to <strong>search the facility</strong>, gather hidden components, and <strong>build a weapon from scratch</strong>. But the Morph won't wait. It adapts. It listens. It <strong>knows</strong> you